  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The first step is to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "blanch",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "blanch-cabbage"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " the cabbage leaves until they are just pliable enough to roll without splitting. The rolls then braise slowly in tomato sauce in the oven until fully cooked and tender. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use a large firm white cabbage. The outer leaves are biggest and easiest to work with."
          }
        ]
      },
